combination of columns and rows.

::: {#f697cdb0 .cell execution_count=14}
``` {.python .cell-code}
import polars.selectors as cs

gt_pl_air.tab_style(
    style=style.fill(color="yellow"),
    locations=loc.body(
        columns=cs.exclude(["Month", "Day"]),
        rows=pl.col("Temp") == pl.col("Temp").max()
    )
)
```

